Package: groundtruth
Title: Reproducible Gaussian Simulation Studies with Explicit Fit Accounting
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Shinichi", "Nakagawa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "snakagaw@ualberta.ca")
Description: Generate independent Gaussian linear data, compare fitting adapters,
    retain every attempt, replay recorded random streams, and export paired data
    with provenance. Summaries report point estimation error, Monte Carlo
    uncertainty, and interval coverage with explicit failure denominators.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, digest
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), roxygen2, pkgdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://itchyshin.github.io/groundtruth/, https://github.com/itchyshin/groundtruth
BugReports: https://github.com/itchyshin/groundtruth/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
